add "decision-hypothesis-comparison: learned-policy-hypothesis-partially-supported — p99 reduction confirmed at 38.4pct, but 12pct CPU overhead on routing nodes unlikely disqualifying given routing nodes not typically bottleneck; cache hit rate gain 71.2pct-to-83.6pct provides downstream origin-offload offset not captured in hypothesis; failover unchanged across all policies; hypothesis framing too pessimistic for cache-heavy workloads" to tracked-decisions

